# Optimizer provenance fact sheet

Introducing paper for Adam, AdamW and Lion. Every fact was read on the cited arXiv page during this task, after finding the paper with a web search; none comes from memory. "Year first appeared" is the year of the initial (v1) arXiv submission.

| Optimizer | Introducing paper (title) | First author | Year first appeared | arXiv identifier | Source URL |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Adam | Adam: A Method for Stochastic Optimization | Diederik P. Kingma | 2014 (v1, 22 Dec 2014) | arXiv:1412.6980 | https://arxiv.org/abs/1412.6980 |
| AdamW (decoupled weight decay) | Decoupled Weight Decay Regularization | Ilya Loshchilov | 2017 (v1, 14 Nov 2017) | arXiv:1711.05101 | https://arxiv.org/abs/1711.05101 (v1 page: https://arxiv.org/abs/1711.05101v1) |
| Lion (EvoLved Sign Momentum) | Symbolic Discovery of Optimization Algorithms | Xiangning Chen | 2023 (v1, 13 Feb 2023) | arXiv:2302.06675 | https://arxiv.org/abs/2302.06675 |

## Notes

